[Desktop Entry]
# Enclave OS — Ristretto presented as "Photos".
Type=Application
Name=Photos
GenericName=Image Viewer
Comment=View your photos and pictures
Exec=ristretto %U
Icon=org.xfce.ristretto
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
Categories=Graphics;Viewer;Photography;GTK;
MimeType=image/png;image/jpeg;image/gif;image/webp;image/bmp;image/tiff;image/svg+xml;image/x-icon;image/heif;image/avif;
Keywords=photos;pictures;images;viewer;gallery;
